<title>PERU: Peru's money base contracts 1.1 pct in September.</title>
<headline>Peru's money base contracts 1.1 pct in September.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peru's money base fell 1.1 percent during September to stand at 3.547 billion soles at the end of the month, the Central Reserve Bank said on Monday.</p>
<p>The money base ended last year at 3.658 billion soles, up from 2.672 billion soles at the start of 1995.</p>
<p>-- Andrew Cawthorne, Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134</p>
</text>
